  "detail":
  "```lean\nEquiv.sigmaCongr.{u_1, u_2, u_3, u_4} {α₁ : Type u_1} {α₂ : Type u_2} {β₁ : α₁ → Type u_3} {β₂ : α₂ → Type u_4}\n  (f : α₁ ≃ α₂) (F : (a : α₁) → β₁ a ≃ β₂ (f a)) : Sigma β₁ ≃ Sigma β₂\n```\n***\nTransporting a sigma type through an equivalence of the base and a family of equivalences\nof matching fibers \n***\n*import Mathlib.Logic.Equiv.Defs*",
