  "endPos": 4065,
  "detail":
  "```lean\nFunction.cantor_injective.{u_4} {α : Type u_4} (f : Set α → α) : ¬Function.Injective f\n```\n***\n**Cantor's diagonal argument** implies that there are no injective functions from `Set α`\nto `α`. \n***\n*import Mathlib.Logic.Function.Basic*",
  "definitionStartPos": {"line": 288, "column": 8},
  "definitionPath":
  "/Users/hattoriseiji/Autoinformalization/ExportInfos/./.lake/packages/mathlib//Mathlib/Logic/Function/Basic.lean",
  "definitionEndPos": {"line": 288, "column": 24}},
